---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact"
  description="Request a free Practice Health Snapshot, or talk to Datafore about clinic intelligence for your allied health practice."
>
  <section class="border-b border-graphite-200 bg-bone">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-graphite-950 md:text-5xl">Request a Practice Health Snapshot</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-600">
        Send us a note and we'll run a snapshot on your clinic's own data: where utilisation sits, what no-shows
        and gaps are costing, and how many patients have quietly lapsed. It's free, there's no commitment, and the
        findings are yours regardless of what you do next.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href="mailto:info@datafore.ca?subject=Practice%20Health%20Snapshot"
        class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-200 bg-white p-6 transition-colors hover:border-vital-500"
      >
        <p class="measure-label text-vital-700">Email</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-graphite-950">info@datafore.ca</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graphite-600">Usually the fastest way to reach us.</p>
      </a>
      <a
        href="tel:+17787001733"
        class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-200 bg-white p-6 transition-colors hover:border-vital-500"
      >
        <p class="measure-label text-vital-700">Phone</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-graphite-950">+1 778 700 1733</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-graphite-600">Burnaby, BC — Pacific time.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-graphite-200 bg-white p-6">
      <p class="measure-label text-vital-700">Office</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-graphite-950">4353 Halifax Street, Burnaby, BC, Canada</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-lg bg-bone-dim p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-graphite-950">Useful things to mention</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-600">
        <li>Which practice management system you run (Jane, Cliniko, Owl, or something else).</li>
        <li>Roughly how many practitioners and locations.</li>
        <li>The number you most wish you had a straight answer to.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
